{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0af68d41b2def58658562b89a9142b8766d9fddf2047760702d9556d86c64cfb","ja":"3人寄れば","zh":"3人齐聚","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b3e38e7a1e677d19849d6f33637544cbb07a7872ae51b2d68213f6b116dcd870","ja":"この前、公式サイトで公開したありさの写真を、\n雑誌の編集者さんが、すごく気に入ってくれたんです。","zh":"之前在官方网站上公开的亚利沙的照片，\n杂志的编辑非常中意呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2c71070c50f93bb83ba0d9ad2fc5c811ebaf457c0c77267dee69b4493f129554","ja":"それで、今度の企画にぜひ、ありさの写真をって、\n声をかけていただいて……。","zh":"所以，对方就来找我说，\n希望在下次的企划中务必用上亚利沙的照片……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"90dd9abf39bb5480a5c3f1f06b86722d8f33f520dd3f5ec4e7684e2b7a75ba0f","ja":"すご～い☆　それじゃあ、ありりんが\n疲れてたのって、その写真を準備してたから？","zh":"好厉害～☆　这么说来，亚利沙那么\n累，是因为在准备那些照片吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0221c709ce97077fae891875fbd083f1957f901b04aabbd8ece09cdaa65b15fa","ja":"はい……。皆さんを写した写真はどれも素晴らしく、\nどれを選べばいいか、ず～っと悩んでました……。","zh":"是的……拍下大家的每张照片都很棒，\n我一直在纠结到底该选哪张才好……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bb7823e58169d21efb8c42576bd3ef4acd388d2927dd7b78a1f33442357b0d60","ja":"あ、でもご飯はちゃんと食べてますし、\nしっかり睡眠もとってますよ！？　体は元気なんです！","zh":"啊，不过饭有好好在吃，\n睡眠也很充足哦！？身体其实很有精神的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2761e31a61af06a52d562cf3049b2f3ad949d423961500b1c7b07657dc683286","ja":"そっか、体調不良じゃなかったんだね。\nよかった～。","zh":"这样啊，原来不是身体不舒服啊。\n太好了～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6d943057c4e7a9c5f6ed5e12c42777f1d86effe8dbb79ef28a165b6c25cb12f2","ja":"うん！　……あれっ？　でもなんで隠してたの？\n言ってくれたらよかったのに。","zh":"嗯！……咦？不过为什么要隐瞒呢？\n明明跟我们说一声就好了嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a902cbafebad5ff6873ddf28105cea74ca4179827c62d33c801d60b11199d2c6","ja":"それは……ありさにきたお仕事だったので、\n自分ひとりでちゃんと解決しなければと……。","zh":"那是……因为是找上亚利沙的工作，\n所以觉得必须由我自己一个人好好解决才行……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"6c478735512dcabdcaf9e9ff4ff343d34f5036be2c9eedc8734ca3ca6fd66f21","ja":"ですが……うう。結局おふたりに気を遣わせて\nしまいました！　今日こそはなんとしても選びます！","zh":"但是……呜呜。结果还是让两位为我操心\n了！今天无论如何我都要选出来！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"ccc278cd80c72439523513b7b8a4b4378df9ba236cd2ebe482bb43c105779ff0","ja":"スト～ップ！　それ以上抱えてたら、\nもっと疲れちゃうよ？　だから、みんなで考えてみよ！","zh":"停～下！再一个人硬撑下去的话，\n会变得更累哦？所以，大家一起来想想办法吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"515859afc8fad0836256ea3849f06a3215d3292dd3f6978c746a8142a99e5857","ja":"そうだね。ひとりじゃ選べなくても、\n3人で話し合えばできるかも！","zh":"也是呢。就算一个人选不出来，\n3个人商量一下的话说不定就行了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"df88af3c0758f3faab14de9d4ef592e58c880746925f217edac944524d2def16","ja":"ほあああっ……ま、まさに天使！\nありさのために、天使が舞い降りた～！？","zh":"哇啊啊……简直、简直就是天使！\n天使降临到亚利沙身边了～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"58b8cf048326e81f873a0459915596de413612dfa9c485f78a2abf2eb2fc0dfd","ja":"ありがとうございます！　ありさ、感激です……！\nこの感動を残すために、写真を撮らせてください！","zh":"非常感谢！亚利沙太感动了……！\n为了留下这份感动，请让我拍张照片吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ae166403adb9f2c917ad7185b43e11a9da66ec3c68a18e1eaf7ce46a515182b7","ja":"ええっ！？\nう、うん。もちろんいいけど……。","zh":"咦！？\n嗯、嗯。当然可以，不过……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1725.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"55b10d83ee632442b89bc6c19374d30bf83b738bd26c65a99611a2da5303029b","ja":"あはは、すっかり元気になったね！\nじゃあ……はい、ポーズ☆","zh":"哈哈，完全打起精神来了呢！\n那么……来，摆个姿势☆","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
